flowchart TB
  accTitle: Choose an agent execution interface
  accDescr: Framework and Server can offer native tools, Bashkit, Monty Python Code Mode and full session sandboxes. Choose by interface and runtime requirements; Bashkit already includes Python.
  P[Framework or Server platform] --> N[Native tools: individual typed operations and interaction]
  P --> B[Bashkit: shell scripts, pipelines and CPython WASM]
  P --> M[Monty: Python tool interface and durable program continuations]
  P --> S[Session sandbox: native packages, processes and full workspace]
